      "writtenOn": "2023-06-07T17:58:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Why is the polynomial in this form? I see it aligns with ::Discriminant and ::Roots, but why is this form better?\n\nI browsed through https://people.eecs.berkeley.edu/~wkahan/Qdrtcs.pdf and I only seemed to see \"suppose you have a quadratic of this form\" and not explain why.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 72,
        "startChar": 10,
        "endLine": 72,
        "endChar": 29
      },
      "revId": "cae1d78e7ff824322b9ea7e2b2a8396500f7700f",
